blocks.en:
DROP counts and quantifiers that describe both lungs together (‘several’, ‘multiple’, ‘a few’, ‘one or two’, ‘two to
three’), size maxima and ‘largest …’ clauses unless the original places them on the {side} side, and partial
qualifiers (‘some calcified’, ‘asymmetric’) that cannot be assigned to one side;

